[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 33240.708, "timestamp": "09:14:00", "text": "地獄。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33244.63, "timestamp": "09:14:04", "text": "哦，這裡有一張地圖。哦，我要被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33247.908, "timestamp": "09:14:07", "text": "撞倒了。嗯，我記得這個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33251.268, "timestamp": "09:14:11", "text": "地方。這是我第一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33254.15, "timestamp": "09:14:14", "text": "和Yeah, Jack一起體驗呃…電腦警察。你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33257.428, "timestamp": "09:14:17", "text": "你知道是怎麼回事。是的。我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33260.47, "timestamp": "09:14:20", "text": "這件事很容易讓人栽跟頭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33262.228, "timestamp": "09:14:22", "text": "是的，尤其是如果你玩的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33264.548, "timestamp": "09:14:24", "text": "恐怖分子一方的話。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33267.83, "timestamp": "09:14:27", "text": "我，夥計。兄弟，這是T方地圖。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33272.03, "timestamp": "09:14:32", "text": "這是CT方的地圖，兄弟。操，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33277.868, "timestamp": "09:14:37", "text": "兄弟。我們死定了。我們死定了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33297.708, "timestamp": "09:14:57", "text": "你在狙擊嗎，兄弟？不行，不允許狙擊手"}]